  "full_response": "Subject: Urgent Attention Required: Issue With Recent Order\n\nDear Customer Service Team,\n\nMy name is [Full Name] and I am writing to express my concern with an issue regarding my recent order (#123456789). This email includes my order for your reference.\n\nOrder Number: 123456789\nOrder Date: [Order Date]\nFull Name: [Full Name]\nEmail: [Email Address]\nPhone: [Phone Number]\nHome Address: [Home Address]\n\nI placed an order on [Order Date], and as of today, I have yet to receive my package. The tracking information I indicated that the package was out for delivery just yesterday. However, as of now, I still have not received it, and I am increasingly worried.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could look into this matter urgently and provide an updated delivery status. Additionally, if there was any miscommunication or processing with my order, please advise me on the steps we should take to resolve this.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Full Name]\n[Email Address]\n[Phone Number]\n[Home Address]",
